  "label": "User projected onto the textual material expressing sarcastic self-deprecation",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material, specifically the phrase 'as if i had enough time to insult you bastards individually', which uses the deictic 'you' to directly address the viewer/user. The user is also implicitly projected onto the overall scene and visual material, as the meme's humor relies on the user recognizing themselves as the 'you' being sarcastically addressed. The projection is onto the textual material because it contains the explicit deictic 'you', which directly targets the user.",
